# Typing.com

> Typing.com is a free web-based typing education platform that provides keyboarding lessons, typing tests, typing games, and digital literacy and coding curricula for students K-12 and adults.

## Key facts:

- Typing.com is web-only — there are no mobile apps
- Available in English, Spanish (Español), and Portuguese (Português)
- The platform is entirely free for schools and teachers with unlimited students, classes, and full administrative features
- A premium PLUS Edition exists for additional features
- Operated by Teaching.com
- Integrates with Google Classroom, Clever, and ClassLink for SSO and rostering
- Texas-specific: Officially adopted for Texas Technology Applications courses under Proclamation 2024 and STAAR-aligned

